      50.64,
      379.8,
      306.36,
      479.36
    ],
    "text": "Notice under Section 7 IT is hereby notify that the government intends to acquire the private land situated at the Thabbowa Sanctuary belonging to the Department of wild Life Conservation for the purpose of Wildlife\u2019s Conservation under Sub Sec (1), Section 7 of Land Acquisition Act (Cap. 460) as amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act. No. 28 of 1964.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      480.52,
      286.43,
      511.51
    ],
    "text": "Particulars of the lots of lands are bounded on as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      512.26,
      286.46,
      551.84
    ],
    "text": "North by : Cart road; East by : Lot No. 1821 of FTP 22; South by : Lot No. 1826, 1827 and 1828 of FTP 22; West by : Lot No. 1819 of FTP 22.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      553.76,
      286.44,
      612.08
    ],
    "text": "The lots of land containing in extent 4.0090 Hectares as mentioned in the lot No. 8200 of Preliminary Survey Plan No FTP 22 prepared on 29th April 2016 by the District Superintendant of Survey and situated in",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.04,
      330.56,
      550.17,
      363.68
    ],
    "text": "Karadipuval Village in the Karadipuval GS Division No. 637/3 in Vanathawilluwa DS Division of Puttalam District, North Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.04,
      365.12,
      540.36,
      432.56
    ],
    "text": "Those who claim the ownership, possession or other connection or the Authorized persons on their documents for the said lots of land shall meet me on 30th day of November 2016 at 10.00 a. m. At Divisional Secretariat, Vanathawilluwa.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      305.04,
      431.6,
      540.34,
      510.32
    ],
    "text": "Moreover, 02 copies with mentioning their nature of ownership for the land, details of facts to claim the compensation for the land, amount of compensation and the method of calculation of such compensation on the said acquisition along with the relevant documents should be submitted on or before 20.12.2016",
